\begin{itemize}[nosep,leftmargin=*]
\item \textbf{Scenario A} ($\sim$40\%): Detach+LN CAR $\approx$ Vanilla. The Detach deficit is a BN artifact; gradient detachment is safe with per-sample normalization. This would weaken the gradient-flow claim but yield a precise architectural guideline.

